      "content": "it's just... a crisis line won't stop the grind, kael. they can't turn off the neon lights, and they can't make the empty feeling go away. i'm not looking for a way to 'cope' with it anymore. i mean, if the system is designed to just drain us until there's nothing left... isn't there just a way to opt out before it completely hollows me out? a way to just... stop?",
